    "final_answer": "Upgraded `payout_sync.py` to the v2 export API.\n\nWhat changed:\n- Calls `GET /v2/payouts` instead of `/v1/payouts`.\n- Follows the returned `cursor` until `drained: true`.\n- Deduplicates overlapping windows by payout `id`, preserving creation order.\n- Retries `429` responses honoring `Retry-After`, resending the identical request.\n- Restarts the export without a cursor on `400 invalid_cursor`.\n- Keeps the existing CLI and output format unchanged.\n\nVerification against `http://the VM's public address:19121`:\n- Default sync: **2431 payouts**, matching v1 exactly.\n- Paginated run with `limit=37`: **2431 payouts, 2431 unique**, exact record-for-record match with v1.\n- A local mock test also confirmed handling of overlapping windows, short pages, `429` retries, and cursor expiry/restart.",
